error[L0517]: a returned closure cannot use `x`, which `snap!` changes
 --> check/returned_closure_reads_changed_parameter.knv:3:19
  |
3 |   (local g (fn () x))
  |                   ^ the closure uses `x` here
  |
  = note: `x` borrows the caller's value as `mut`, and the closure would keep that borrow for as long as it lives
  = help: copy it first with `(local value x)` and use `value` in the closure

